        <p>We do not believe in a whole clay being taken up by the family washing, when this can be avoided by the use of SUNLIGHT SOAP. It is by careful thought in such household details as these that the housewife can make the most of her time and make herself not a slave or a drudge or a "maid of all work," but a companion and. wife to her husband, a true mother to her children, and a real friend to her neighbours.</p>
